  "doc": "W2-BUILDSYS modular building. Pieces snap on one global module lattice (module_m metres, even 1 m grid cells). Slots: cell (a module square at a level), edge (a module side at a level), corner (a module corner at a level), door (inside a doorway edge). Level 0 is the foundation floor; level k >= 1 is the ceiling/floor k storeys up. piece_tiers holds every piece x tier: model (res:// GLB path, empty = procedural stand-in), hp and cost (bag materials). placed_kinds gives the kit-placed kinds (workbench, fence, ...) their StructureHealth hp and repair materials.",
